5,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Um... hello everyone. I'm not very good at this, but I'll try my best.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Shion,,Let's be efficient. Logic is the only way to find the wolf. I'll be observing your patterns closely.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Logic is fine, kid, but don't forget that people lie. I'll just enjoy watching the chaos.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Midori,,It's nice to meet you all. Let's try to get along and find the werewolf together peacefully.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,George,,I agree with Midori. A calm approach is best. I'll rely on my experience to guide us.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shion, you seem very confident... maybe I should listen to you?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Shion,,You should. Intuition is just a guess; I prefer evidence. Does anyone have a strategy?,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Shunichi,,"My strategy is to see who trips over their own words. @George, you're awfully quiet.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Midori,,"Now, now, let's not start accusing people already. We should establish how we'll communicate first.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,George,,I prefer to observe first. I'll speak when I have something concrete to contribute.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Daisuke,,I just hope we don't fight too much... it makes me nervous.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Shion,,Nervousness is a tell. I'll be noting who gets agitated when questioned.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Shunichi,,"How clinical. I bet the werewolf is the one pretending to be the most ""logical.""","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Midori,,"Let's try to be supportive. If we trust each other, it'll be easier to spot the liar.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,George,,"Trust is earned, Midori. But harmony helps us think clearly.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Daisuke,,I'll just... follow what the group decides.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Shion,,Fine. We'll focus on contradictions tomorrow.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
