35,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,Good morning... I hope everyone is okay.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,1,talk,Shion,,"Let's get to it. Since no one died yet, we have a clean slate. Who feels suspicious?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"I'm feeling great. Though, @Daisuke looks like he's about to cry. Suspiciously timid, isn't he?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Midori,,"@Shunichi, please be kind to him. He's just shy. I think we should look for actual clues.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,George,,I've had a look at the situation. I believe I have a lead on who the werewolf is.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,@George... do you really know? I trust your judgment.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@George, if you have information, share it. Withholding data is counterproductive to the village.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"Oh, look at the ""detective"" and the ""analyst"" teaming up. How predictable.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Midori,,"If George has something, he should tell us, but let's make sure we don't rush to judgment.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,George,,I can tell you that Shunichi is the werewolf. I've seen through his facade.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,@Shunichi... are you really? You seemed so sure of yourself.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Shion,,"A direct claim from George. @Shunichi, your reaction to this accusation will be very telling.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""George"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"Ha! The old man is just guessing or lying to look important. I'm a human, obviously.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Midori,,This is a very serious accusation. Are we sure we can trust George's word immediately?,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,George,,I am the Seer. My divination does not lie. Shunichi is the enemy.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I... I believe George. He seems very honest.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Shion,,The probability of George lying as the Seer is lower than Shunichi lying as the wolf. I'm voting Shunichi.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""George"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,You're all falling for the simplest trick. This is disappointing.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,Midori,,"I don't want to cause a mistake, but the evidence seems to be piling up.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,1,4,talk,George,,The choice is clear. Let us end this now.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
